<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<section xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" id="fs-id1170655150800" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID"><title>Ayo Nganggo Variabel lan Tandha Aljabar</title><para id="fs-id1170655151082">Upamane taun iki Greg umure 20 taun lan Alex 23 taun. Alex luwih tuwa 3 taun tinimbang Greg. Nalika Greg umure 12 taun, Alex 15 taun. Yen Greg wis umur 35 taun, Alex bakal umur 38 taun. Dadi, pira wae umure Greg, Alex tetep luwih tuwa 3 taun, ta? Ing basa aljabar, umure Greg lan Alex kuwi <term id="term-00001">variabel</term><emphasis effect="bold"/>, dene 3 kuwi <term id="term-00002">konstanta</term>. Umure wong loro kuwi owah-owah, nanging selisihe tetep 3 taun. Amarga selisih umure Greg lan Alex mesthi 3 taun, 3 kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">konstanta</emphasis>.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655059811">Ing aljabar, aksara dienggo makili variabel. Yen umure Greg ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">g</emphasis>, bisa nganggo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>g</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo nulis umure Alex. Delengen <link target-id="fs-id1170654967711"/>.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654967711" aria-label="Tabel iki ana limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kiwa tulisane &quot;Umur Greg&quot;, kolom tengen &quot;Umur Alex&quot;. Ing kolom Greg ana 12, 20, 35, lan g. Ing kolom Alex ana 15, 23, 38, lan g + 3.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Greg</entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top">Umur Alex</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>20</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>38</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext></m:math></entry>
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext mathvariant="bold-italic">g</m:mtext><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655195814">Aksara sing dienggo makili umur sing owah-owah iki jenenge <emphasis effect="italics">variabel</emphasis>. Aksara sing kerep dienggo dadi variabel yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>, lan <emphasis effect="italics">c</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170654997446">
<title>Variabel</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655128406"><term id="term-00003">Variabel</term> kuwi aksara sing makili wilangan sing nilaine bisa owah.</para>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655160769">
<title>Konstanta</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655189845"><term id="term-00004">Konstanta</term> kuwi wilangan sing nilaine mesthi tetep.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655224522">Yen arep nulis nganggo aljabar, butuh wilangan, variabel, lan tandha operasi. Ana sawetara jinis tandha sing bakal dienggo.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654981807">Ana papat <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00005">operasi</term> ngetung sing dhasar: <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00006">panambahan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00007">pangurangan</term>, <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00008">ping-pingan</term>, lan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00009">paran</term>. Tandha kanggo operasi iki ana ing tabel ngisor iki. Mbokmenawa sawetara wis kokweruhi.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178881" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana limang larik lan patang kolom. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane &quot;Operasi&quot;, kolom kapindho &quot;Notasi&quot;, kolom katelu &quot;Diwaca&quot;, lan kolom pungkasan &quot;Asile...&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Operasi&quot; ana panambahan, pangurangan, ping-pingan, lan paran. Ing kolom &quot;Notasi&quot; ana wujud aljabar. Larik data kapisan isine a, tandha tambah, b. Larik sabanjure isine a, tandha kurang, b. Larik ping-pingan ana limang wujud: a, tandha titik ping-pingan, b; ab; a ing njero kurung banjur b ing njero kurung; a ing njero kurung banjur b; lan a banjur b ing njero kurung. Larik paling ngisor ana patang wujud. Sing kapisan yaiku a, tandha para, b. Sing kapindho yaiku a, garis miring, b. Sing katelu yaiku a ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan b ing ngisor garis pecahan. Sing kapapat yaiku b ing njaba kurung para gapit lan a ing njero kurung para gapit. Ing kolom &quot;Diwaca&quot; ana &quot;a ditambah b&quot;, &quot;a dikurangi b&quot;, &quot;a ping b&quot;, lan &quot;a dipara b&quot;. Ing kolom &quot;Asile...&quot; ana &quot;gunggung a lan b&quot;, &quot;selisih a lan b&quot;, &quot;asil ping-pingan a lan b&quot;, lan &quot;asil paran a lan b; a kuwi wilangan sing dipara, lan b jenenge pembagi&quot;.">
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Diwaca:</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asile…</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ditambah <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Pangurangan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dikurangi <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Ping-pingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Paran</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mtext>/</m:mtext><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mfrac><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:menclose notation="longdiv"><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:menclose></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kuwi wilangan sing dipara, lan <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> jenenge pembagi</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655126801">Operasi iki dienggo ing rong wilangan. Yen ngowahi tandha dadi basa Indonesia, utawa basa Indonesia dadi tandha, gatekna tembung basa Indonesia “dari” (basa Jawane: “saka”) lan “dan” (basa Jawane: “lan”).</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424846753" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Selisih</emphasis> 9 lan 2 tegese njupuk 2 saka 9, utawa 9 dikurangi 2. Yen ditulis nganggo tandha, dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
<item><emphasis effect="italics">Asil ping-pingan</emphasis> 4 lan 8 tegese ngitung 4 ping 8, utawa 4 ping 8. Yen ditulis nganggo tandha, dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655004454">Ing aljabar, tandha silang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> ora dienggo nuduhake ping-pingan amarga bisa nggawe bingung. Apa 3<emphasis effect="italics">xy</emphasis> tegese <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mo>×</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (“telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>”) utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> (telu ping <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> ping <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis>)? Supaya cetha, nganggoa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>·</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> utawa tandha kurung kanggo ping-pingan.</para>
<para id="fs-id1171789687379"><newline/></para>
<para id="fs-id1170655208137">Yen rong besaran nilaine padha, loro-lorone diarani padha lan disambungake nganggo <term id="term-00010">tandha padha karo</term>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655025665">
<title>Tandha Padha Karo</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654990403"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> wacane “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis>”</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655126926">Tandha <m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>“=”</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> jenenge <emphasis effect="bold">tandha padha karo</emphasis>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655108736">Ing garis wilangan, saya nengen nilaine saya gedhé. Garis wilangan bisa dienggo njlentrehake tandha “&lt;” lan “&gt;”.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655207857">
<title>Bandhingan Ora Padha</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167270244162" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr/><m:mtr/><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>wacane “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>luwih cilik tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ana ing kiwa</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1170652623871" alt="Garis wilangan: titik a ana ing kiwa titik b.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_001_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<equation id="fs-id1167269909313" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>wacane “</m:mtext><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>luwih gedhé tinimbang</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mtext>”</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ana ing tengen</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mspace width="0.2em"/><m:mtext>ing garis wilangan</m:mtext></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<media id="fs-id1167269961954" alt="Garis wilangan: titik b ana ing kiwa titik a.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_002_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655155145">Wujud <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b utawa a &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> bisa diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen utawa kosok baline, nanging biasane diwaca saka kiwa menyang tengen (<link target-id="fs-id1170655178120"/>). Umume, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; b tegese padha karo b &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>. Tuladhane, 7 &lt; 11 tegese padha karo 11 &gt; 7. Semono uga, <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &gt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> tegese padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis> &lt; a. Tuladhane, 17 &gt; 4 tegese padha karo 4 &lt; 17.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655178120" aria-label="Tabel iki ana enem larik lan rong kolom. Larik ndhuwur isine judhul saben kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane “Tandha Bandhingan” lan kolom kapindho “Wacane”. Ing kolom “Tandha Bandhingan” ana: a, tandha ora padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih cilik tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih cilik utawa padha karo, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé tinimbang, b; a, tandha luwih gedhé utawa padha karo, b. Ing kolom “Wacane” ana: “a ora padha karo b”, “a luwih cilik tinimbang b”, “a luwih cilik utawa padha karo b”, “a luwih gedhé tinimbang b”, lan “a luwih gedhé utawa padha karo b”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tandha Bandhingan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Wacane</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">ora padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> &lt; <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih cilik utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a &gt; b</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé tinimbang</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">luwih gedhé utawa padha karo</emphasis> <emphasis effect="italics">b</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655113222">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654999980">
<problem id="fs-id1170655020482">
<para id="fs-id1170654984453">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa. Sumbere nganggo basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654989586"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655105413">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<para id="fs-id1166424795899"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
17 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 26<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
8 ora padha karo 17 dikurangi 3<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 27 dipara 3<newline/><newline/>
<span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline/>
<emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 19</para></solution>
</exercise>
</example>
<note id="fs-id1170654935250" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655166352">
<problem id="fs-id1170654985390">
<para id="fs-id1170654943066">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa. Sumbere nganggo basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655190264"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>≤</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>≠</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654943209">
<para id="fs-id1170655353526"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 14 luwih cilik utawa padha karo 27 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 19 dikurangi 2 ora padha karo 8 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 12 luwih gedhé tinimbang 4 dipara 2 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dikurangi 7 luwih cilik tinimbang 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655124058" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655205783">
<problem id="fs-id1170655166119">
<para id="fs-id1170655203511">Owahana saka aljabar dadi ukara basa Jawa. Sumbere nganggo basa Indonesia:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655174550"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>≥</m:mo><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&lt;</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655192260">
<para id="fs-id1170655222902"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 19 luwih gedhé utawa padha karo 15 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 7 padha karo 12 dikurangi 5 <span class="token">ⓒ</span> 15 dipara 3 luwih cilik tinimbang 8 <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah 3 luwih gedhé tinimbang 6</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654957487">Tandha panglumpukan ing aljabar kuwi mèmper karo koma, titik loro, lan tandha wacan liyane ing basa Indonesia. Tandha iki nggawe cetha wujud aljabar endi sing kudu diklumpukake lan dipisahake saka wujud liyane. Saiki ayo kenal telung jinise.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655219760">
<title>Tandha Panglumpukan</title>
<equation id="fs-id1167269979347" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung biasa</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em"/><m:mrow><m:mo>(</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>)</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung siku</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.15em"/><m:mrow><m:mo>[</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>]</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mtext>Kurung kurawal</m:mtext></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mrow><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mrow/><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654880176">Iki sawetara tuladha wujud aljabar sing nganggo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00011">tandha panglumpukan</term>. Mengko ing subbab iki, ayo ngowahi wujud kaya ngene dadi luwih prasaja.</para>
<equation id="fs-id1170654936322" class="unnumbered"><label/><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd/><m:mtd/><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mo>{</m:mo><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>}</m:mo></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id1166424830424"><newline/></para>
<para id="fs-id1170654957085">Apa bedane frasa lan ukara? Frasa kuwi ngandharake siji gagasan sing durung pepak yen madeg dhewe. Ukara ngandharake sawijining bab kanthi pepak. Iki padanan basa Jawa saka tuladha ing sumber basa Indonesia: “Mlayu banter banget” kuwi frasa, nanging “Wong sing dolanan bal-balan kuwi mlayu banter banget” kuwi ukara. Ing tuladha iki, ukara duwe subjek lan predikat. Ing aljabar, ana <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655102379">
<title>Wujud Aljabar</title>
<para id="fs-id1170654958000"><term id="term-00012">Wujud Aljabar</term> kuwi wilangan, variabel, utawa gabungan wilangan lan variabel sing nganggo tandha operasi.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654988522"><emphasis effect="bold">Wujud Aljabar</emphasis> kuwi mèmper karo frasa ing basa Indonesia. Iki sawetara tuladha wujud aljabar lan padanan tembung-tembunge ing basa Jawa:</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655221887" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana telung kolom lan limang larik. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane “Wujud Aljabar”, kolom kapindho “Tembung-tembung”, lan kolom katelu “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Wujud Aljabar” ana: 3, tandha tambah, 5; n, tandha kurang, 1; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7; x ing ndhuwur garis pecahan lan y ing ngisor garis pecahan. Ing kolom “Tembung-tembung” ana: “3 ditambah lima”, “n dikurangi siji”, “6 ping 7”, lan “x dipara y”. Ing kolom “Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “gunggung telu lan lima”, “selisih n lan siji”, “asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu”, lan “asil paran x lan y”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Wujud Aljabar</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Tembung-tembung</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Frasa Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">3 ditambah 5</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">gunggung telu lan lima</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">selisih <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> lan siji</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">6 ping 7</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mfrac><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi>y</m:mi></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> dipara <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">asil paran <emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<para id="fs-id1170655003585">Ing sumber basa Indonesia, frasa-frasa sing wis dipadhakake ing tabel mau durung dadi ukara sing pepak amarga ora duwe predikat.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654938230"><emphasis effect="bold">Persamaan</emphasis> kuwi dumadi saka rong wujud aljabar sing digandhengake nganggo <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00013">tandha padha karo</term>. Yen tandha-tandha ing persamaan diwaca nganggo tembung-tembung, ing sumber basa Indonesia dadi ukara sing pepak. Ing pepadhan iki, tandha padha karo dadi predikate. Ing ngisor iki ana padanan basa Jawane.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655118064">
<title>Persamaan</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655170220"><term id="term-00014">Persamaan</term> kuwi rong wujud aljabar sing digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170655111405">Iki sawetara tuladha persamaan.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170655090988" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana rong kolom lan nem larik. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane “Persamaan” lan kolom kapindho “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia”. Ing kolom “Persamaan” ana: 3, tandha tambah, 5, tandha padha karo, 8; n, tandha kurang, 1, tandha padha karo, 14; 6, tandha titik ping-pingan, 7, tandha padha karo, 42; x, tandha padha karo, 53; y, tandha tambah, 9, tandha padha karo, 2, y, tandha kurang, 3. Ing kolom “Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia” ana padanan basa Jawa: “Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu”, “n dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas”, “Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro”, “x padha karo sèket telu”, lan “y ditambah sanga padha karo loro y dikurangi telu”.">
<label/>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Persamaan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Padanan Ukara Basa Indonesia</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Gunggung telu lan lima padha karo wolu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis> dikurangi siji padha karo patbelas.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Asil ping-pingan enem lan pitu padha karo patang puluh loro.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>53</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">x</emphasis> padha karo sèket telu.</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> ditambah sanga padha karo loro <emphasis effect="italics">y</emphasis> dikurangi telu.</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170654953357"><exercise id="fs-id1170654953360">
<problem id="fs-id1170655229951">
<para id="fs-id1170655162511">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna:</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655153999"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655111791">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-10" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake bedane wujud aljabar lan persamaan, karo tuladha lan katrangan kanggo saben jinis.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong wujud aljabar digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓒ</span> <m:math><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:math></entry>
   <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">wujud aljabar</emphasis>—ora ana tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>

<row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓓ</span> <m:math><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>40</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry>Iki kuwi <emphasis effect="italics">persamaan</emphasis>—rong wujud aljabar digandhengake nganggo tandha padha karo.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>



</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655166808" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170654924234">
<problem id="fs-id1170654924237">
<para id="fs-id1170655124883">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655226888">
<para id="fs-id1170655120617"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> persamaan <span class="token">ⓑ</span> wujud aljabar</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655205588" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655022136">
<problem id="fs-id1170655027224">
<para id="fs-id1170655027226">Saben wujud ing ngisor iki kalebu wujud aljabar utawa persamaan? Temtokna: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>y</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>÷</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>22</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654959582">
<para id="fs-id1170654959584"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> wujud aljabar <span class="token">ⓑ</span> persamaan</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654982105">Upamane arep nggawe asil ping-pingan saka sangang faktor, saben faktore padha karo 2. Bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Nulis kaya ngene kuwi repot lan angel ngetung ana pira angka 2, mula nganggo eksponen. Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> bisa ditulis dadi <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ing wujud aljabar kaya <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> angka 2 jenenge <emphasis effect="italics">wilangan dhasar (basis)</emphasis> lan angka 3 jenenge <emphasis effect="italics">eksponen</emphasis>. Eksponen nuduhake ana pira faktor sing saben-saben padha karo wilangan dhasar.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655219218" alt="Ana angka loro karo angka telu sing ditulis ing sisih tengen ndhuwur, jenenge superskrip. Ana panah nuding angka loro kanthi tulisan “wilangan dhasar”, lan panah liyane nuding angka telu ing ndhuwur kanthi tulisan “eksponen”. Tegese, gawe asil ping-pingan saka telung faktor sing saben-saben padha karo 2, yaiku 2 ping 2 ping 2.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_003_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1166420392829">Tulisan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “loro pangkat telu” utawa “loro kubik”.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170654953415">Wujud <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">tulisan pangkat</emphasis> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditulis nganggo <emphasis effect="italics">tulisan dawa</emphasis>.</para>
<note id="fs-id1170655107718">
<title>Tulisan Pangkat</title>
<para id="fs-id1170655213989"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> tegese asil ping-pingan saka faktor sing saben-saben padha karo <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis>, kanthi cacah faktor <emphasis effect="italics">n</emphasis>, lan n kudu wilangan bulat positif.</para>
<media id="fs-id1170655111941" alt="Ana a karo n sing ditulis ing sisih tengen ndhuwur minangka superskrip. Ana panah nuding a kanthi tulisan “wilangan dhasar”, lan panah liyane nuding n ing ndhuwur kanthi tulisan “eksponen”. Ing ngisore ana persamaan a superskrip n padha karo a ping a ping a ping elipsis ping a. Iki nuduhake faktor a sing dipingake, cacah faktore n, nanging nilai n durung ditemtokake. Ana tandha kurung ing ngisor faktor-faktor a mau kanthi tulisan “n faktor”.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_ElemAlg_Figure_01_02_004_img_new.jpg"/>
</media>
<para id="fs-id1170655228836">Wujud Aljabar <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1170654937018">Senajan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> diwaca “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> pangkat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>n</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math>”, biasane diwaca:</para>
<list id="fs-id1166424875923" list-type="bulleted" bullet-style="bullet">
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kuadrat”</item>
<item><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> “<emphasis effect="italics">a</emphasis> kubik”</item>
</list>
<para id="fs-id1170655195218">Mengko bakal cetha apa sebabe <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> duwe jeneng mligi.</para>
<para id="fs-id1170655112606"><link target-id="fs-id1170654954100"/> nuduhake carane maca sawetara wujud aljabar sing nganggo eksponen.</para>
<table id="fs-id1170654954100" aria-label="Tabel iki ana limang larik lan rong kolom. Larik paling ndhuwur isine judhul kolom. Kolom kapisan tulisane &quot;Wujud Aljabar&quot; lan kolom kapindho &quot;Nganggo Tembung-tembung&quot;. Larik kapindho isine 7 superskrip 2 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure isine 5 superskrip 3 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik sabanjure isine 9 superskrip 4 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;9 pangkat papat&quot; ing kolom kapindho. Larik paling ngisor isine 12 superskrip 5 ing kolom kapisan lan &quot;12 pangkat lima&quot; ing kolom kapindho.">
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1"/>
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2"/>
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top">Wujud Aljabar</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">Nganggo Tembung-tembung</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">7 pangkat loro utawa 7 kuadrat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">5 pangkat telu utawa 5 kubik</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">9 pangkat papat</entry>
</row>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="center" valign="top"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pangkat lima</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1170655121051"><exercise id="fs-id1170655121053">
<problem id="fs-id1170654954435">
<para id="fs-id1170654954437">Gawe luwih prasaja: <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655003298">
<title>Cara Ngrampungake</title>
<table id="eip-958" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Cara ngetung nilai wujud pangkat 3^4, langkah mbaka langkah.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry> </entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:msup><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:msup></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen kabeh faktor sing dipingake.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna saka kiwa menyang tengen.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>·</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Pingna.</entry>
    <entry>81</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</solution>
</exercise>
</example><note id="fs-id1170655196165" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655197165">
<problem id="fs-id1170655197167">
<para id="fs-id1170655102365">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170654954209">
<para id="fs-id1170654954211"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 125 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 1</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1170655102894" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1170655194687">
<problem id="fs-id1170655194690">
<para id="fs-id1170655025314">Gawe luwih prasaja: <span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math> <span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1170655114557">
<para id="fs-id1170655114560"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> 49 <span class="token">ⓑ</span> 0</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>